unlike many games where different songs have different themes for each character or area wintory chose to base all of pieces on one theme which stood for player and their journey with cello solos especially representing player wintory describes music as like big cello concerto where you are soloist and all rest of instruments represent world around you though he describes it as not necessarily orchestral due to inclusion of electronic aspects cello begins game as immersed sea of electronic sound before first emerging on its own and then merging into full orchestra mirroring player journey to mountain while game art style based on several different cultures wintory tried to remove any overt cultural influences from music to make it as universal and culture less as possible tina features as cellist for soundtrack she close friend of wintory and has since performed woven variations with him an eight minute orchestral variation on journey soundtrack all of non electronic instruments soundtrack were recorded with live orchestra 
